From 95d1e7510a34cd320c3c72d45a2ae4a9d66bc0d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (audit)" <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 08:23:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] audit-cleanup: roles, refusal workflow, dead code removal
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add permissions matrix (super_admin/admin/operator)
- Fix Operators register: role respected, user.id returned, auto-approve works
- Refusal workflow: operator initiates with notes, admin approves/returns
- Remove duplicate Profile page (redirect to /settings)
- Trim Settings to Profile + Notifications only
- Add Settings to sidebar, rename Operators -> Сотрудники
- NotFound: framer-motion -> motion/react
- Schedule: working complete button + remove dead inputClass
- Applications: pending_admin_approval status + filter pill
- Gate transport edit/expense behind correct roles
